Code for paper on the equilibrium electric double layer structure and interfacial tension due to adsorbed ionic surfactants. [(Uhlig and Khair 2026)](https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcis.2025.137924).

All of the data and figures will be generated in the one script, [`equilibrium_double_layer_figs.py`](equilibrium_double_layer_figs.py)
Note this script renders text in LaTeX and thus requires a LaTeX installation.

The raw data contined in the script was obtained using [Plot Digitizer](https://plotdigitizer.com/#:~:text=Plotdigitizer%20is%20an%20online%20data,from%20images%20in%20numerical%20format.) 
on the data collected by [Warszynski and coworkers](https://doi.org/10.1021/jp983901r) and from the paper by [Borwankar and Wasan](https://doi.org/10.1016/0009-2509(88)85106-6) 
which cites the original source of the data as being from [Haydon and Phillips](https://doi.org/10.1039/TF9585400698).
